{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2023-01-06 07:59:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR ANNOUNCES INVESTMENT IN LITHOS ENERGY INC. TO FURTHER BATTERY PACK DEVELOPMENT AND MANUFACTURING', 'text': 'DEAL WILL HELP TO ACCELERATE THE DEVELOPMENT OF CATERPILLAR\'S ELECTRIFIED PRODUCT PORTFOLIO IRVING, TEXAS , JAN. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR\xa0INC.\xa0(NYSE:CAT) ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY IS INVESTING\xa0IN LITHOS ENERGY, INC.,\xa0A U.S.-BASED BATTERY TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT PRODUCES LITHIUM-ION BATTERY PACKS. "CATERPILLAR\'S COLLABORATION WITH LITHOS SUPPORTS OUR COMMITMENT TO DELIVERING ROBUST ELECTRIFIED PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS FOR OUR CUSTOMERS," SAID JOE CREED, GROUP PRESIDENT OF CATERPILLAR\'S ENERGY & TRANSPORTATION SEGMENT.'}